<view class="td-page"><view class="td-card"><view class="td-title">TokenDance</view><view>{{connected ? '已连接' : '未连接'}}</view><view class="td-note">使用自己的账户额度生成和精修图片。授权 Key 加密保存在服务端。</view><button bindtap="authorize" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{connected ? '重新授权' : '连接 TokenDance'}}</button><view wx:if="{{state}}"><view class="td-note">链接已复制。在系统浏览器完成授权，将一次性 code 粘贴到下方。</view><input placeholder="一次性授权 code" password value="{{code}}" bindinput="codeInput"/><button bindtap="exchange" disabled="{{busy || !code}}">完成授权</button><button bindtap="cancel">取消授权</button></view><button wx:if="{{connected}}" bindtap="disconnect">解除连接</button></view>
<view class="td-card" wx:if="{{connected}}"><view class="td-title">钱包</view><view wx:if="{{balance}}">可用余额 ¥{{balance}}</view><button bindtap="queryBalance">查询余额</button><view class="td-note">钱包余额与 Key 额度不同。Key 额度需在 TokenDance 查看，充值不会调整 Key 限额。</view><view>充值金额（人民币元）</view><input type="number" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="amountInput"/><button bindtap="createPayment" disabled="{{busy}}">创建 ¥{{amount}} 充值单</button><button bindtap="recentPayments">查看最近充值记录</button><view wx:if="{{payment}}"><view>¥{{payment.amount}} · {{payment.status === 'paid' ? '已确认到账' : payment.status === 'pending' ? '等待支付' : payment.status === 'refunded' ? '已退款' : '支付未完成'}}</view><button wx:if="{{payment.status === 'pending' && payment.alipay_url}}" bindtap="copyAlipay">复制支付宝支付链接</button><view class="td-note" wx:if="{{payment.status === 'pending'}}">微信小程序不能直接唤起支付宝。请用系统浏览器打开支付宝链接，或在图研网页充值；返回后查询支付状态。</view><button bindtap="paymentStatus">查询支付状态</button></view><button bindtap="openWebWallet">复制图研网页钱包入口</button></view><view class="td-error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="td-note" wx:if="{{notice}}">{{notice}}</view></view>
